I have checked the type 'System.PexAssemblyInfo' in my solution but cannot see how this exception can be caused by it. It is not something I can reference to change as the code was generated by Pex. Any guesses what might be causing this? Is it an error I caused by not including the correct imports for Pex? I'm using Pex 4.1.804.0. 
